			"date": "2024-03-25T19:56:18.000Z",
			"content": "<p><span class=\"h-card\" translate=\"no\"><a href=\"https://fediverse.zachleat.com/@zachleat\" class=\"u-url mention\" rel=\"nofollow noopener\" target=\"_blank\">@<span>zachleat</span></a></span> <span class=\"h-card\" translate=\"no\"><a href=\"https://toot.cafe/@slightlyoff\" class=\"u-url mention\" rel=\"nofollow noopener\" target=\"_blank\">@<span>slightlyoff</span></a></span> Wrote about this here: <a href=\"https://infrequently.org/2024/01/performance-inequality-gap-2024/\" rel=\"nofollow noopener\" translate=\"no\" target=\"_blank\"><span class=\"invisible\">https://</span><span class=\"ellipsis\">infrequently.org/2024/01/perfo</span><span class=\"invisible\">rmance-inequality-gap-2024/</span></a> and did a talk on it, video here: <a href=\"https://cfe.dev/sessions/jamdev2024-market-for-lemons/\" rel=\"nofollow noopener\" translate=\"no\" target=\"_blank\"><span class=\"invisible\">https://</span><span class=\"ellipsis\">cfe.dev/sessions/jamdev2024-ma</span><span class=\"invisible\">rket-for-lemons/</span></a></p>",
