			"date": "2024-03-25T20:13:37.000Z",
			"content": "<p><span class=\"h-card\" translate=\"no\"><a href=\"https://front-end.social/@a11yMel\" class=\"u-url mention\" rel=\"nofollow noopener\" target=\"_blank\">@<span>a11yMel</span></a></span> <span class=\"h-card\" translate=\"no\"><a href=\"https://fediverse.zachleat.com/@zachleat\" class=\"u-url mention\" rel=\"nofollow noopener\" target=\"_blank\">@<span>zachleat</span></a></span> IDK, I'm suffering through a lot of \"apps used internally at large corporations\" right now, and they're not OK. Not even on beefy machines, and I know for a fact that many folks in the org have worse/more-taxed machines</p>",
			"via": "fediverse"
		},
