			"content": "<p><span class=\"h-card\" translate=\"no\"><a href=\"https://fediverse.zachleat.com/@zachleat\" class=\"u-url mention\" rel=\"nofollow noopener\" target=\"_blank\">@<span>zachleat</span></a></span> same for \"best case safe\": as long as you follow the law, the procedures &amp; regulations, the schedules, the training, common sense, reasonableness, all patches, all updates, all guidelines, and take personal responsibility for any of the holes, live in a bubble where you can afford all that money and time, it will all be safe!</p>",
